Maintainer: QuakeC Studio contributors <https://github.com/quakecstudio/editor/issues>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libasound2t64 | libasound2, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libvulkan1 | libgl1
Recommends: libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, mesa-vulkan-drivers, gnome-keyring
